Next, memory issues like memory leaks or excessive memory usage. The code initializes a struct and copies values into it, but I don't see any obvious memory leaks. However, if the struct isn't properly deinitialized, it could lead to issues.

Looking at input validation, the code doesn't seem to handle user inputs, so this might not be a concern here. But if any of the variables come from untrusted sources, there could be injection flaws.

